{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"The first `work.write` was refused: `build_tenants/codex` does not exist, and the tool requires the target’s parent directories to exist. The actor artifact directory is also absent. My activation permits only host reads and computation outside `work.write`, so I cannot create those directories through the shell. I’m retaining the refusal and returning the missing prerequisite without claiming a candidate.\n\n"}}
